# img2threejs working artifacts — reference photos (third-party), captured
# screenshots, evidence JSON/logs, and local pipeline state. Ignore the whole
# directory, then re-admit only the two files that are the actual source of
# truth for regenerating the model: the authored spec and its assessment.
# Everything else here (di.json, analysis.md, gate results, comparison
# sheets, camera-solve output, crops...) is derived working evidence, cheap
# to regenerate by re-running the pipeline against the spec.
.img2threejs/*
!.img2threejs/object-sculpt-spec.json
!.img2threejs/assessment.json

# Copied here only so the Vite dev server can serve them as texture URLs for
# the review harness — the real copies live in .img2threejs/material-evidence/.
public/material-evidence/

# Local preview/session state from the editor's dev-server integration.
.freebuff/
